  "data": {
    "body": "A real $2 \\times 2$ matrix $A$ has an eigenvalue $\\lambda_{1}=2+i$ with corresponding eigenvector $\\mathbf{v}_{1}=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}3-i \\\\ 4+i\\end{array}\\right]$. Which of the following is the general REAL solution to the system of differential equations $\\mathbf{x}^{\\prime}(t)=A \\mathrm{x}(t)$ ?",
